  "notes": "{所有|しょゆう} is a formal term for ownership or possession, commonly used for property, assets, and legal rights.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- 〜を{所有|しょゆう}する: to own ~\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {所有者|しょゆうしゃ}: owner\n- {所有権|しょゆうけん}: ownership rights, title\n- {所有物|しょゆうぶつ}: property, possessions\n- {土地|とち}{所有|しょゆう}: land ownership\n- {共同|きょうどう}{所有|しょゆう}: joint ownership\n- {私有|しゆう} / {国有|こくゆう} / {公有|こうゆう}: private / state / public ownership\n\nCONTRAST WITH {所持|しょじ}:\n- {所有|しょゆう}: ownership — broader concept including property rights\n- {所持|しょじ}: possession — physically carrying or having on one's person",
